# ::tok The index is based on several parameters examined by each authority , which examine the level of " friendliness " of the authority to businesses in its field .
# ::node	i	index	1-2
# ::node	b	base-02	3-4
# ::node	s	several	5-6
# ::node	p	parameter	6-7
# ::node	e2	examine-01	7-8
